<section class="panel" id="step5">
    <div class="actions">
      <button id="btn-load-demo" class="btn">🎲 载入示例</button>
    </div>

    <h2 class="sec">校验结果 <span id="vbadge"></span></h2>
    <ul class="vlist" id="vlist"></ul>

    <section class="card submission-card" aria-labelledby="submission-title">
      <h2 class="sec" id="submission-title">提交审核</h2>
      <div class="submission-actions">
        <button id="btn-submit-review" type="button" class="btn primary">提交审核</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">提交当前内容快照并创建审核 PR；图片任务可按编号查询结果，需要人工处理时请联系维护者。</p>
      <div id="submission-status" class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="sec mt-4">内容预览</h2>
    <div class="prev" id="preview"></div>


    <section class="card" id="local-save-section" aria-labelledby="local-save-title">
      <h2 class="sec" id="local-save-title">保存到本地</h2>
      <p id="local-save-hint" class="hint">本地备份不会提交审核，也不会自动保存后续修改。可通过顶部「导入现有攻略」恢复。</p>
      <div class="backup-options">
        <div class="stack"><button id="btn-save-local" type="button" class="btn" aria-describedby="json-save-hint">仅保存文本（JSON）</button><p id="json-save-hint" class="hint">保存攻略内容和图片引用，不包含图片文件。</p></div>
        <div class="stack"><button id="btn-save-package" type="button" class="btn" aria-describedby="zip-save-hint">保存图片+文本（ZIP）</button><p id="zip-save-hint" class="hint">包含攻略内容及本地图片，适合完整备份；外链图片仍需联网。</p></div>
      </div>
      <div id="local-save-status" class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div id="package-save-status" class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>
  </section>
